      <p class="text-[#a89878]">FFM is an independent tournament organizer
        providing scheduled match coordination and prize pool management. We are
        not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Garena.</p>
      <h2 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">2.
        Financial Ledger &amp; Wallet Rules</h2>
      <p class="text-[#a89878]">All wallet transactions are tracked via an
        append-only internal ledger. Balances cannot be directly manipulated by
        client applications. Withdrawals are subject to compliance reviews.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>